    """Parse and fully validate a submitted CRL for one trust root.

    Enforces, in fixed order: PEM/ASN.1 parse as an X.509 v2 CRL; presence
    of CRLNumber and nextUpdate; thisUpdate not after ``now``; nextUpdate
    strictly after both thisUpdate and ``now``; issuer DN equal to the
    trust-root subject; signature verifiable by the trust-root public key;
    and every revoked entry carrying a non-negative, non-duplicate serial.
    Raises :class:`CrlValidationError` (sanitized category only) on the
    first failed rule.
